5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to find out who the werewolf is. Do you think they're hiding right in front of us?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,It's certainly possible. We should all stay observant and try to analyze each other's behavior carefully to find the truth.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Minako. Since we have no information yet, we should pay close attention to how everyone speaks and reacts during these first few turns.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready! I'll find that werewolf no matter where they're hiding. Just tell me who looks suspicious and I'll handle it!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Let's just take it slow. Being too aggressive might make it easier for the werewolf to blend in.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, you're so serious! But that's part of the fun, right? I wonder if the werewolf is someone who's trying to act all calm and quiet!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"That is a valid hypothesis, Sakura. Often, those who try too hard to appear inconspicuous are the ones hiding something. We should keep an eye on the quietest among us.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"If we focus only on the quiet ones, we might overlook someone who is intentionally being overly active to distract us. We must be balanced in our observations.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Exactly! Like Sakura, maybe someone is just acting hyper to throw us off. I'm watching everyone!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'm not trying to hide anything, I just think we should avoid jumping to conclusions without any evidence.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, @Takumi is watching me? I'm just being myself! But maybe the real werewolf is someone who's trying to sound too smart to trick us!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Analyzing the logic of the arguments is important, but we must be careful not to mistake intelligence for deception. Let's see if anyone's claims start to contradict themselves.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"I'll be watching for those contradictions. For now, I'm curious if anyone has a specific strategy for how we should handle the voting process tomorrow.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I think we should just vote for whoever is the most suspicious! If we're not sure, we can't just sit around. We have to be brave and make a choice!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"Voting without evidence is risky, Takumi. We could accidentally execute a villager, which only helps the werewolf. We should wait for the Seer's information if they choose to share it.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,The Seer! I wonder who the Seer is! Maybe they'll tell us something super juicy tomorrow. I can't wait to see everyone's faces when the truth comes out!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minako,,We must remember that the Seer might choose to keep their identity secret to avoid being targeted. Let's be mindful of how we handle any information revealed tomorrow.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Victoria,,"That's a good point, Minako. If the Seer reveals themselves too early, they become an immediate target for the werewolf. We should be cautious about how we encourage them to speak.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about being cautious! If the Seer knows who the werewolf is, they should just shout it out so we can end this quickly!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"That's exactly why we need to be careful, Takumi. If the Seer is too loud, they'll be gone by tomorrow night. Let's just listen to everyone for now.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
