31,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning everyone! Did you all sleep well? I wonder if the Seer found something scary last night! Who do you think is the werewolf?,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Since I am the Seer, I can tell you that I have some information, but I believe it is safer to observe the group's reactions for a moment before I reveal my findings.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"That is a very prudent approach, Minako. By waiting, we can see if the werewolf tries to frame someone or if they react nervously to the fact that you have information.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Wait, you're the Seer, Minako? Then just tell us! Why keep us waiting when we could be catching the werewolf right now?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, please calm down. Minako is trying to protect herself and the village. If she reveals everything immediately, the werewolf knows exactly who to kill tonight.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wow, Minako is the Seer! That's so cool! But @Takumi is right, I'm dying to know! Did you find a scary werewolf, or is everyone just a regular human?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I divined Misaki last night, and she is human. While this doesn't identify the werewolf, it does narrow down our suspects and gives us a reliable ally in the village.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Thank you for sharing that, Minako. Knowing Misaki is human is a helpful starting point. Now, I wonder if the werewolf will try to cast doubt on your claim or Misaki's identity.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Fine, so Misaki is safe. But that still leaves three of us! @Sakura, you've been acting way too excited about this. Are you trying to distract us from yourself?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'm just listening to the conversation, Takumi. Sakura's personality has been the same since the start; it's hard to tell if that's a distraction or just how she is.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, that's so mean! I'm just happy to be playing! Why are you always picking on me? Maybe you're the werewolf and you're trying to make me look bad!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Let's avoid emotional accusations. Takumi's suspicion is based on behavior, and Sakura's defense is a natural reaction. We should look for more concrete patterns before we decide who to vote for.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Minako. We have very little to go on. However, the werewolf often tries to deflect suspicion by accusing others quickly. Takumi, your eagerness to find a target is a bit concerning.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"What?! Now you're all turning on me just because I want to win? I'm just being honest! If we're too scared to point fingers, the werewolf is just going to keep eating us!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"It's not about being scared, Takumi, it's about being precise. If we act on impulse, we're doing the werewolf's work for them. We need to think logically about who benefits from this chaos.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I think Misaki is being way too helpful! She's always telling Takumi to calm down and talking about logic. Maybe she's just trying to look like a good person so we don't suspect her!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minako,,"Sakura, I have already confirmed Misaki's identity as human through my divination. Unless you are suggesting that I am lying about my role or my findings, Misaki is not the werewolf.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"Exactly. Sakura, by attacking someone who has already been cleared by the Seer, you are either being very clumsy or intentionally trying to sow confusion. That is a very suspicious pattern.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"See! I told you she was acting weird! Sakura, you're just trying to confuse us because you're the werewolf! I'm voting for you!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"I appreciate the support, but let's stay focused. Sakura, attacking a confirmed human is a mistake that a villager wouldn't usually make. It really does make you look like you're trying to disrupt our logic.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
